OL,3,GNEWSABridge structure lifted into place
OL,4,Aover River Avon
OL,5,
OL,6,FA project to build a new walking and
OL,7,Fcycling crossing in Worcestershire has
OL,8,Freached a new milestone after the
OL,9,Fbridge's structure was successfully
OL,10,Flifted into place.
OL,12,FThree sections measuring more than 90m
OL,13,F(295ft) in total and two leg sections
OL,14,Fweighing about 100 tonnes, have been
OL,15,Finstalled on Hampton Bridge, over the
OL,16,FRiver Avon in Evesham, Worcestershire,
OL,18,FThe installation required a specialist
OL,19,Fcrane and temporary closure of the
OL,20,Friver to ensure the lift could be
OL,21,Fcarried out safely, the county council
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
