OL,3,GNEWSABridge structure lifted into place
OL,4,Aover River Avon
OL,5,
OL,6,FConstruction of the bridge, which is
OL,7,Fexpected to cost #16m, is scheduled for
OL,8,Fcompletion in summer 2027.
